{
  "name": "demo_find",
  "title": "在样本文本里找字",
  "description": "在一份本机 UTF-8 文本里找一个词或一句话，交回每处的段号、行号和前后文。简繁、全角半角、行尾断词都能找到；整句找不到时按词找（几个词在同一段），并标出来。没找到就换个说法，或少几个词。",
  "params": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "file": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "UTF-8 文本的路径"
      },
      "query": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "要找的词或句子"
      },
      "max_hits": {
        "type": "integer",
        "default": 20,
        "minimum": 0,
        "maximum": 100,
        "description": "最多交回几处；0 只计数"
      },
      "context": {
        "type": "integer",
        "default": 40,
        "minimum": 0,
        "maximum": 200,
        "description": "前后各留多少字"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "file",
      "query"
    ]
  },
  "result": "每处命中：段号和行号、命中处原样的文字、前后各若干字、整句还是按词（按词时每个词各算一处）；另给一共几处、是不是只列了前几处。",
  "result_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "hits": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "total": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0
      },
      "truncated": {
        "type": "boolean"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "hits",
      "total",
      "truncated"
    ]
  },
  "errors": [
    {
      "kind": "not_text",
      "message": "文件不是 UTF-8 文本。",
      "hint": "请换一份 UTF-8 文本。",
      "retry": false
    }
  ],
  "cost": {
    "kind": "local"
  },
  "confirm": {
    "kind": "never"
  },
  "effects": {
    "network": false,
    "writes": "none"
  },
  "examples": [
    {
      "args": {
        "file": "examples/demo/sample.txt",
        "query": "认知模型"
      },
      "expect": {
        "contains": "第 1 段第 2 行",
        "data": {
          "total": 1,
          "truncated": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "args": {
        "file": "examples/demo/sample.txt",
        "query": "self-attention"
      },
      "expect": {
        "contains": "第 2 段第 5 行",
        "data": {
          "total": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "args": {
        "file": "examples/demo/sample.txt",
        "query": "English model"
      },
      "expect": {
        "contains": "按词找到 2 处",
        "data": {
          "total": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "args": {
        "file": "examples/demo/sample.txt",
        "query": "认知",
        "max_hits": 0
      },
      "expect": {
        "data": {
          "total": 2,
          "truncated": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "args": {
        "file": "examples/demo/missing.txt",
        "query": "认知"
      },
      "expect": {
        "error": "file"
      }
    }
  ]
}
